<div class="container"><h1>巨火甲虫 (Giant Fire Beetle)</h1>
<div class="table-wrap"><table><thead><tr><th class="col-1">资料栏位</th><th class="col-data">巨火甲虫<br><span style="font-weight:normal;font-size:13px;">小型虫类</span></th></tr></thead><tbody>
<tr><td class="col-1">生命骰</td><td>1d8 (4HP)</td></tr>
<tr><td class="col-1">先攻</td><td>+0</td></tr>
<tr><td class="col-1">速度</td><td>30英尺 (6格)</td></tr>
<tr><td class="col-1">防御等级</td><td>16 (+1体型、+5天生)、接触11、措手不及16</td></tr>
<tr><td class="col-1">基本攻击/擒抱</td><td>+0 / -4</td></tr>
